    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449940/extras/c6994c6a1d7f6e42cc658cc95c4df833.avif?t=1742063287\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Enter the Maze, Hunt for Diamonds, and Outsmart Your Opponent!</strong> \ud83d\udc8e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Diamond Hunter</i> is a <strong>fast-paced, third-person multiplayer game</strong> where players navigate a <strong>dynamically generated maze</strong>, avoid deadly <strong>spiders and dragons</strong>, and use strategic gadgets to <strong>outplay their rival</strong>. In this <strong>1v1 showdown</strong>, only the smartest and fastest hunter will claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>1v1 Competitive Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Face off against another player in an ever changing maze. Outsmart, outmaneuver, and outlast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Glowsticks &amp; Bombs</strong> \u2013 Use glowsticks to light your path and bombs to clear obstacles, or take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f <strong>Minion Threats: Spiders &amp; Dragons</strong> \u2013 Beware of the lurking dangers! <strong>Spiders</strong> will chase you down, while <strong>dragons</strong> guard key areas of the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce1 <strong>Minion &amp; Diamond Detectors</strong> \u2013 Track your enemies and locate precious diamonds before your opponent does!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Dynamic Mazes</strong> \u2013 Each round features a <strong>new, randomly generated maze</strong>, ensuring no two matches are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Strategic Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Use clever tactics to <strong>trap your opponent, escape danger, or steal victory at the last second</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you <strong>outsmart your rival and become the ultimate Diamond Hunter</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist &amp; Play Now!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1449940/extras/c6994c6a1d7f6e42cc658cc95c4df833.avif?t=1742063287\" data-has-big /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc8e <strong>Enter the Maze, Hunt for Diamonds, and Outsmart Your Opponent!</strong> \ud83d\udc8e</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Diamond Hunter</i> is a <strong>fast-paced, third-person multiplayer game</strong> where players navigate a <strong>dynamically generated maze</strong>, avoid deadly <strong>spiders and dragons</strong>, and use strategic gadgets to <strong>outplay their rival</strong>. In this <strong>1v1 showdown</strong>, only the smartest and fastest hunter will claim victory!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>1v1 Competitive Multiplayer</strong> \u2013 Face off against another player in an ever changing maze. Outsmart, outmaneuver, and outlast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca1 <strong>Glowsticks &amp; Bombs</strong> \u2013 Use glowsticks to light your path and bombs to clear obstacles, or take down enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd77\ufe0f <strong>Minion Threats: Spiders &amp; Dragons</strong> \u2013 Beware of the lurking dangers! <strong>Spiders</strong> will chase you down, while <strong>dragons</strong> guard key areas of the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udce1 <strong>Minion &amp; Diamond Detectors</strong> \u2013 Track your enemies and locate precious diamonds before your opponent does!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Dynamic Mazes</strong> \u2013 Each round features a <strong>new, randomly generated maze</strong>, ensuring no two matches are ever the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca3 <strong>Strategic Power-Ups</strong> \u2013 Use clever tactics to <strong>trap your opponent, escape danger, or steal victory at the last second</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you <strong>outsmart your rival and become the ultimate Diamond Hunter</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist &amp; Play Now!</strong></p>",
